 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Shiroi Buta Kizoku desu ga Zense no Kioku ga Haeta no de Hiyoko na Otouto Sodatemasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "白豚貴族ですが前世の記憶が生えたのでひよこな弟育てます"
   },
   {
    "en": "I'm the White Pig Nobleman, but With the Memories of My Previous Life, I'll Raise My Little Brother"
   },
   {
    "en": "I'm a White Pig of an Aristocrat, but I Developed Memories of My Previous Life, So I'm Raising My Younger Brother to Be Like a Small Chick"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a different world where Western and Chinese cultures are mixed. Ageha is born into this world as the hated son of Count Kikunoi in the Qilin Empire. It seems that in the future, his younger brother Regulus will kill him in a succession fight.\n\nAgeha's only weapon is the memory of his previous life. However, he still decides to raise his younger brother because \"- My little brother is super cute, isn't he?\". He creates educational toys by hand and develops steamed egg custard for his little brother who is like a chick. He mobilizes all his special skills and housework abilities of past life to improve the underdeveloped area!",
   "ja": "腐敗した大国・麒凰。その片隅で暮らす、不仲な両親に見放された肥満児（五歳）――伯爵家長男・鳳蝶【あげは】に生えたのは、日本人としての前世の記憶だった。腹違いの弟・レグルスに出逢い、成長した彼に爵位継承権を巡り殺されるという未来を受け入れた鳳蝶は、実母を亡くした幼い弟を放ってもおけず育てることに。キラキラふわふわで純真無垢なレグルスに懐かれ……気づけばすっかり親（兄）バカに！"
  },
